<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2TH" style="id">2 OTESA - ELOYI TRANSLATION PROJECT</book>
  <para style="h">2 Otesaloniya</para>
  <para style="toc1">Kwupu Ungwopo Ungwu Ɔpɔlu A Ka Laa Enzu Umba OTESALONIYA</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Otesaloniya</para>
  <para style="toc3">2 Otesa</para>
  <para style="mt2">Kwupu Ungwopo Ungwu Ɔpɔlu A Ka Laa Enzu Umba</para>
  <para style="mt1">OTESALONIKA</para>
  <para style="imt">Kambu Iyemo</para>
  <para style="ip">Kwupu ungwopo ungwu Ɔpɔlu a ka laa enzu umba Otesalonika kwɔlɛ, Ɔpɔlu a lɔ ngwu kwuyengwu e yi mu Ɔkɔrɛtiya. A lɔ ngwu mizhikembo iyi ɛvya bwɛɛ iyi bɔkɔ a lɔ kwupu ungwu kwonze. Enzu umbafo ɔ zɔngɔma iso iyi bɔkɔ Ɔpɔlu e so mekeka iyi inyɔma iyopo iyi Ɔzhizɔsi ma mo. Enzu umbafo o zɔ te Ɔkwu a gba-a. Iso ɛlɛ i ta kaambu mu ɔshɔshi uwu Otesalonika. Kwuwo kwɔlɛ, Ɔpɔlu a gba a ka mba kwupu kwɔlɛ kpɔ akwɛyi a za mba tee apula iyifo i wo dɛ gba Okrasi a gbama le. U to keyi uwu o ya wu tee &lt;&lt;Onzu Uwura,&gt;&gt; uwu bɔkɔ a gyi Okrasi mo gba a nya laa ira iyɛkwuu iyi bɔkɔ o do ma yi dɛ mo le.</para>
  <para style="ip">E kyo e lolo mbo tee uwewe la rima ngiri mu ikwidufulo wo, la nyama kaa ovyo mbala inyashi li ka wu ma mbala Okrasi imbwaluma mo, lɔ kyakpɔ mu ɛduma iwomo nzhii ba kwuyengwu Ɔzhizɔsi a ba nyɔ, lo kyo lo wo ɛduma mba laa amasa.</para>
  <para style="iot">Iso Iyi I Yi Memi</para>
  <para style="io1">Kambu Iyemo (1.1-2)</para>
  <para style="io1">Iduma mbala Ipwɔma (1.3-12)</para>
  <para style="io1">Okpa meka iyi Inyɔma iyi Okrasi (2.1-17)</para>
  <para style="io1">Ɛzɔ meka iyi luzɛ undu Umbwalu Okrasi (3.1-15)</para>
  <para style="io1">Imbwama iyi Iso (3.16-18)</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2TH 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TH 1:1" />Imi Ɔpɔlu mbala Osalasi mbala Otimoti gba ki ka kwupu kwɔlɛ le laa enzu umba ɔshɔshi uwu Otesalonika umba bɔkɔ akwu enzu umba Ukpo etenzu mbala Ɔkwu nzu Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi:<verse eid="2TH 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TH 1:2" />Ki lɛ Ukpo Etenzu mbala Ɔkwu nzu Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi te le shi yi esheshi mbala egbo inɔma.<verse eid="2TH 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ombwu Izɔma kwuyengwu Inyɔma Iyi Okrasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TH 1:3" />Ɛmɛnɛ mi, kinzu ki yi mu Ukpo ɛnyi igbɛlɛma kwuwo ungwu akwu ɛga te la ki gbɛlɛ wu ɛnyi kwuyengwunanguna kwuwo yi. Ki gbɛlɛ Ukpo ɛnyi kwuwo ungwu idu kwu fulo iya yi mu Ɔzhizɔsi mbala idɛnyi iyi esu iyi bɔkɔ i yi mu ikyomo <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fp" closed="false" /></note>kwɔfyi kwɔfyi. <verse eid="2TH 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TH 1:4" />Kwuwo ngwɔlɛ kinzu ki kwu ɛnwu kwuwo yi mu ɛshɔshi uwu Ukpo lɛɛbi Kwuwongwu bɔkɔ lu rima ngiri mbala idu kwu fulo mbala imondomo iyi bɔkɔ o o mondo yi lɛɛbi ba lu yi idu. <verse eid="2TH 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TH 1:5" />Ɛlɛ lɛɛbi i zɔ te ombu uwu Ukpo akwu ongbulolo, kwuwongu inyashi iyi bɔkɔ lu yi mu imama le, ɛlɛ gba i shi o wa yi te lu kwu ɛmɛ umba Ukpo le . <verse eid="2TH 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TH 1:6" />Ukpo akwu u zɔ ombu ongbulolo, enzu umba bɔkɔ o lo yi inyashi awu, uwu e lo mbo inyashi tete. <verse eid="2TH 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TH 1:7" />Lunyi umba bɔkɔ o ye yi mu inyashi lomo awu ba e shi yi ɛnwu ɛnwu igbomo.Ɛlɛ i wo kwuyengwu bɔkɔ Ɔzhizɔsi a wɔ moshi a nyɔ la kawu imingɔma mbala alɔgbulɔ wu umba ekpasu. <verse eid="2TH 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TH 1:8" />Enzu umba bɔkɔ o yitu iyi Ukpo mo ba o na iso iyi Ɔkwu Ɔzhizɔsi mo, e lo mbo inyashi. <verse eid="2TH 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TH 1:9" />O lo mbo inyashi iyɔkpɔɔ, akwɛyi a ramba ma mu idu iyi Ɔkwu ba o fya ekpasu wu iyɛkwu ɛnyu mo. <verse eid="2TH 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TH 1:10" />Ɔnuwu bɔkɔ Ɔzhizɔsi a ba nyɔ, enzu wu wa kɛrikɛri o du wu akwɛyi wa mbwalu wu o ya kenzu kuwo wu. Ɛlɛ i kyo yi kwuwongu lu nyama mu iso iyi ki so yi le. <verse eid="2TH 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TH 1:11" />Kuwo kwɔlɛ gba ki lɛ Ukpo kwuwo yi iyɔkpɔɔ le te, Ukpo le kyo la wa yi te li kwu enzu wu, kaa mu ekpasu wu la nyɔlɔ ɛduma iyeshi lɛɛbi iyi lu gyi te la lu wo mbala iyinayina iyi lu wo kwuwongu lu nyama la Ɔzhizɔsi. awu. <verse eid="2TH 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TH 1:12" />Ki lɛ Ukpo te ɛnyi iyi Ɔkwu nzu Ɔzhizɔsi li yi iduma meka yi, lunyi ba lu fya ipwɔma meka wu tete,mate esheshi iyi Ukpo mbala Ɔkwu nzu Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi bɔ i yi<verse eid="2TH 1:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TH 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2TH 2" />
  <para style="s1">Onzu Uwoyi A Nyɔ Dɛ Ishi Ɔkwu nzu Ɔzhizɔsi A Ba Gbama Le</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TH 2:1" />Ɛmɛnɛ mi, ki gyi te la ki so yi iso meka iyi igbama iyi Ɔkwu nzu Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi, akwɛyi ɔ kpala nzu ɛlu kaa ki bi du wu, mi so yi te, <verse eid="2TH 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TH 2:2" />egbo yi li kpasha naa li fomo efyefya mo kwuwongu iso iyira iyi enzu umbafo naakwupu ungwu bɔkɔ o zɔ te kwu ngyi munyi nzu te kwɔfyi ungwu igbama iyi Ɔkwu nzu Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi kwu bo-o. <verse eid="2TH 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TH 2:3" />La lu nyama onzu uwunawuna le kyoro yi mo mu ɔgwuzɛ uwunawuna mo, mo kwuyengwu bɔkɔ enzu o towo Ukpo mo, akwɛyi onzu uwoyi uwu bɔkɔ kwogba wu akwu ɔyi awu aa wɔ dɛ ishi Ɔkwu nzu Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi a gbama le. <verse eid="2TH 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TH 2:4" />Onzu uwoyi awu e towo Ukpo mo mbala kiya ingyinangyina ingyi bɔkɔ akwu ingyi Ukpo naa kiya ingyinangyina ingyi bɔkɔ o gbo ngyi ɔya. E to ɛnwu e fulo kadu mu ɔtɛpu uwu Ukpo akwɛyi a zɔ te uwu akwu Ukpo. <verse eid="2TH 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TH 2:5" />Lunyi la lu lolo te, kwuyengwu bɔkɔ mi yi mbala yi awu mi koko mi so yi iso ɛlɛ lɛɛbi. <verse eid="2TH 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TH 2:6" />Lunyi ba lu yitu kiya ingyi bɔkɔ ki shi bɔkɔ onzu uwoyi ele o do wawu kwudu mo. Kwuye kwu nyɔ bɔkɔ Ukpo a wala onzu uwoyi awu kwudu. <verse eid="2TH 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TH 2:7" />Mo ekpasu iyi Onzu uwoyi awu i yi mu ɛduma iwomo mekeka iyi enzu oo. Ukpo uwu bɔkɔ a kpa onzu uwoyi kwota awu, a rangwu tayi nzhii ba kwuyengwu bɔkɔ o ra la onzu uwoyi ele ma. <verse eid="2TH 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TH 2:8" />Mizhikembo iyi ɛlɛ onzu uwoyi ele a wɔ kwudu, akwɛyi kwuyengwu bɔkɔ Ɔkwu nzu Ɔzhizɔsi a gbama, a na wu ekpasu ma akwɛyi a ngbɛ onzu uwoyi ele ɛdɔ ma mu ɛnyɔ ifumo iyi kenzu wu mbala ekpasu iyi igbama wu. <verse eid="2TH 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TH 2:9" />Onzu uwura ele a nyɔ mu ekpasu iyi onzu uwoyi, e wo apula iyi amɛ mbala iyi kenzu iyama iyi imulo gyɔɔ, <verse eid="2TH 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TH 2:10" />mbala kwukyoro iwomo ungwɔku la enzu umba bɔkɔ o yi mu ɔgwuzɛ uwu lukwu. O kpo ɛdɔma kwuwongu o towo iso iyi ototo ma iyi bɔkɔ i shi o fya isama iyi Ukpo. <verse eid="2TH 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TH 2:11" />Kwuwo kwɔlɛ Ukpo e shi kwukyoro ugwɔku te lakwu to mbo egbo mo, akwɛyi o nyama la kwukyoro kwɔlɛ. <verse eid="2TH 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TH 2:12" />Kwuwo kwɔngu, Ukpo e lo onzu uwunawuna inyashi uwu bɔkɔ e shi egbo wu mu iso iyi ototo ɛlɛ mo, ba o mu ɔnyɛ mu ira iwomo.<verse eid="2TH 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O Ŋa Yi Kaa Lo Sayima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TH 2:13" />Ɛmɛnɛ mi umba bɔkɔ Ukpo a gyi yi, akwa nzu ɛga te la ki gbɛlɛ Ukpo ɛnyi kwuyengwunangwuna kwuwo yi, kwuwongu Ukpo a ŋa yi mu iyemo iyi kwudu kwɔlɛ kaa la lu fya isama iyi Ukpo mu ɛduma iwomo iyi Kwundu Ɔkɛrikɛri kaa le shi la lu ŋɔ kɛrikɛri mbala egbo ishimo mu iso iyi ongbulolo iyi Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi. <verse eid="2TH 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TH 2:14" />Ukpo a ya yi ma i zɛ mu rɛnu ingyi Ɔzhizɔsi ingyi bɔkɔ ki tanu ngyi le, kaa lunyi la lu kyo la lu ri kulewu ungwu inzumbɛku iyi Ɔkwu nzu Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi. <verse eid="2TH 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TH 2:15" />Kwuwo kwɔlɛ ɛmɛnɛ mi, ɛzu iyi bɔkɔ ki zɔ yi, kwuyengwu bɔkɔ ki yi mbala yi, kala iyi bɔkɔ ki ka yi mu kwupu awu, la lu ra yi gbagiri.<verse eid="2TH 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TH 2:16" />Ki lɛ Ɔkwu nzu Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi mbala Ada Ɔsu Ukpo uwu e kpo lukwu nzu awu, mu esheshi wu iwomo, a ka nzu ɛnwu ma iyɔkpɔɔ mbala eyi ifulomo iyeshi, <verse eid="2TH 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TH 2:17" />te la ka yi ɛnwu ma kaa la lu fya ekpasu iyi ɛduma iyi esheshi iwomo mbala iso iyi esheshi isomo.<verse eid="2TH 2:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TH 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2TH 3" />
  <para style="s1">La lu Lɛ Ukpo Kwuwo Nzu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TH 3:1" />Mu imbwama yi, ɛmɛmbɛnɛ mi, la lu lɛ Ukpo kwuwo nzu kaa anu iyi Ɔkwu iyi ki yi mu itama le li fulama munamuna akwɛyi enzu oo na yi laa umwɔ, kyamate bɔkɔ lu na yi awu. <verse eid="2TH 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TH 3:2" />La lu lɛ Ukpo kpɔ te Ukpo la wa nzu ma mu kwuwo ungwu enzu umbira mbala enzu umbeyi, moo akwu enzu lɛɛbi gba akwu wa mbwalu le mo. <verse eid="2TH 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TH 3:3" />Ɔkwu ba akwu onzu uwu bɔkɔ o fulo egbo ma wu, ee shi yi ekpasu, a gba aa wa yi ma mɔwu uwu enzu umbeyi. <verse eid="2TH 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TH 3:4" />Kwuwongwu ɔlɛ egbo nzu ina yi ma meka iyi Ɔkwu te apula iyi ki za yi te la lu wo awu, lu yi wo. <verse eid="2TH 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TH 3:5" />Ki lɛ Ukpo te Ɔkwu Ɔzhizɔsi la wu yi eyi mo kaa la lu yitu te Ukpo e pwu idɛnyi yi, ki gba ki lɛ Ukpo kpɔ te le shi yi idu iyimo kyamate bɔkɔ Okrasi e wo tayi.<verse eid="2TH 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔpɔlu E Yi Enzu Umba Oteselonika Malu Ka Lo Wo Ɛduma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TH 3:6" />Ɛmɛnɛ mi, ki so yi mu ɛnyi iyi Ɔkwu Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi te la lu mbwalu ɔgwuzɛ uwu umɛnɛ uwu e wo kelu akwɛyi e towo ɛzɔ iyi ki zɔ yi awu ma mo. <verse eid="2TH 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TH 3:7" />Lunyi mafyi yi lu yitu te i fate la lu mbwalu kwota nzu. Kinzu ki wo kelu kwuyengwu ki yi mbala yi awu mo. <verse eid="2TH 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TH 3:8" />Lunyi mafyi yi lu yitu te ki na kiya ingyirimo rɛshi mu ɔwu uwu ɔzɛnzɛnyi mo. Ki bɔkpɔɔ ki ma wɔnu mu ɛduma iwomo utu la ɔnu kwuwongu kaa la ki kwayi ewulo mo. <verse eid="2TH 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TH 3:9" />Ki wo ɛlɛ, akwu kwuwongu ki do te ki na imbwama munyi yi mo le mo, kinzu ba ki wo ɛnyi kaa la lu vɔngɔ munyi nzu. <verse eid="2TH 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TH 3:10" />kwuyengwu ki yi mbala yi awu ki koko ki so yi te, &lt;&lt;Onzu uwunawuna uwu bɔkɔ e wo ɛduma mo ba le ri mo.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2TH 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TH 3:11" />Ki so yi ɛlɛ kwuwongu ki pwa te umbafo mekeka yi o yi elu. Umba ba o wo ɛduma mo, o ma mu kenzu ilomo mu iso iyi enzu iyi bɔkɔ i kpa mba ɛnwu ma mo. <verse eid="2TH 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TH 3:12" />Enzu mbamba tayi, ki so mbo mu ɛnyi iyi Ɔkwu Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi te lo ki undu ma mɛzhi kaa lo wo ɛduma kaa lo fya kiya ingyi bɔkɔ o ri. <verse eid="2TH 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TH 3:13" />Ɛmɛmbɛnɛ mi , lunyi ba ɛnwu li kwu yi mo mu ɛduma iyeshi iwomo mo.<verse eid="2TH 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TH 3:14" />Onzu uwu bɔkɔ e towo iso iyi bɔkɔ ki ka mu kwupwu kwɔlɛ le imbwalu ma, de la lu bɔ wu eyi. Lunyi la lu gɔ mbala wu mo kaa lovya la lu wo wu mo. <verse eid="2TH 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TH 3:15" />Lunyi la lu to wu kyamate akwu ogewa yi mo, lunyi ba la lu yi wu mu alu kyamate umɛnɛ tayi.<verse eid="2TH 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Iso Imbwambwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TH 3:16" />Mi lɛ Ukpo te Ɔkwu mafyi wu uwu akwu undu uwu idu igbomo awu, le shi yi idu igbomo mu kwuyengwunaguna mbala mu ɔgwuzɛ uwunawuna. Ukpo le yi mbala yi lɛɛbi. <verse eid="2TH 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TH 3:17" />Imi Ɔpɔlu gba mi ka kwupwu kwɔlɛ le mafyi mi, te gba mi ka epu mi le lɛɛbi.<verse eid="2TH 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TH 3:18" />Esheshi iyi Ɔkwu nzu Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi li yi mbala yi lɛɛbi.<verse eid="2TH 3:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TH 3" />
</usx>